WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.149 --> 00:00:06.029
We've been desperately waiting for leadership
from Donald Trump as the country has fallen

00:00:06.029 --> 00:00:14.659
into further disrepair and chaos, combining
a 100 year pandemic with more civil unrest

00:00:14.659 --> 00:00:19.250
than we've seen in a very long time. And as
I told you yesterday, Donald Trump spent the

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:24.640
weekend tweeting from his bunker. He emerged
yesterday to the Rose Garden of the White

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:29.890
House. And instead of being conciliatory,
instead of bringing down tensions, instead

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:38.000
of doing something that we could call sensible
leadership, Donald Trump went full authoritarian,

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.441
saying that when governors don't handle protests
the way Trump wants them to handle them, he

00:00:44.441 --> 00:00:52.510
will activate and deploy the military to states
for law enforcement purposes. Here is Trump

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:58.720
himself making the statement yesterday.
That is why I am taking an immediate presidential

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:06.060
action to stop the violence and restore security
and safety in America. I am mobilizing all

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:12.300
available federal resources, civilian and
military, to stop the rioting and looting,

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:19.790
to end the destruction and arson, and to protect
the rights of law abiding Americans, including

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:28.140
your Second Amendment rights. Therefore, the
following measures are going into effect immediately.

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:35.601
First, we are ending the riots and lawlessness
that has spread throughout our country. We

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:44.870
will end it now. Today, I have strongly recommended
to every governor to deploy the National Guard

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:51.460
in sufficient numbers that we dominate the
streets. Mayors and governors must establish

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:57.659
an overwhelming law enforcement presence until
the violence has been quelled. If a city or

00:01:57.659 --> 00:02:03.510
state refuses to take the actions that are
necessary to defend the life and property

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:10.200
of their residents, then I will deploy the
United States military and quickly solve the

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:14.680
problem for them.
So there are about 100 different things to

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:21.999
talk about here. But don't kid yourselves.
This is not a rehearsal. This is the authoritarian

00:02:21.999 --> 00:02:26.510
nightmare that we've been worried about with
Donald Trump for three and a half years that

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:33.150
has been slowly building and escalating. And
first of all, just like aside from the legality

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:37.859
of this, which I want to talk about, there's
a lot of misinformation spreading about it.

00:02:37.859 --> 00:02:44.000
This is the opposite of what we need. We have
peak unrest in this country started because

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:51.950
law enforcement used too much force in Minneapolis
on George Floyd. So Donald Trump comes out

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:58.669
and says, hey, governors, you need to up the
force used by law enforcement or I will up

00:02:58.669 --> 00:03:06.069
it for you by deploying the military to your
states. It is inconceivable. This is the worst

00:03:06.069 --> 00:03:13.129
possible thing that you could do. Second,
is this legal? Now, there is a lot of misinformation

00:03:13.129 --> 00:03:18.210
and disinformation being spread about this.
So let's actually go through each step. And

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:22.709
I'll tell you where a lot of people are getting
either confused or they're deliberately spreading

00:03:22.709 --> 00:03:27.469
disinformation. So in the United States, we
have something called the Posse Comitatus

00:03:27.469 --> 00:03:33.569
Act or Comitatus Act. I don't know how it's
pronounced. It dates back to 1878. And what

00:03:33.569 --> 00:03:39.809
this act does is it says the federal government
can't use federal military personnel to enforce

00:03:39.809 --> 00:03:44.489
domestic policies. That's exactly what Donald
Trump wants to do. Donald Trump wants to send

00:03:44.489 --> 00:03:50.709
federal military personnel to states to enforce
local law enforcement policy. Understand that

00:03:50.709 --> 00:03:55.029
when a state deploys their National Guard,
that does not violate this law. A lot of people

00:03:55.029 --> 00:04:01.529
don't necessarily make the distinction between
National Guards are state units. They're administered

00:04:01.529 --> 00:04:06.299
by the state governor. And we've had during
Corona virus, we've even had National Guard

00:04:06.299 --> 00:04:13.549
deployed by governors to help with traffic
or test sites or whatever else the case may

00:04:13.549 --> 00:04:19.079
be. Perfectly legal doesn't violate the Posse
Comitatus Act. Donald Trump here is talking

00:04:19.079 --> 00:04:26.931
about deploying federal military assets to
states to enforce a domestic law. And that

00:04:26.931 --> 00:04:32.009
is exactly what is prohibited by the Posse
Comitatus Act. So it's step one now. Step

00:04:32.009 --> 00:04:37.389
two, can Trump get around that? And the answer
is yes, he can. And this is where a lot of

00:04:37.389 --> 00:04:41.610
the disinformation is spreading. So Pit pay
particular attention to the details here,

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:46.740
which are that there is something called the
Insurrection Act. The Insurrection Act can

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:52.659
